OL,3,GNEWSAJunior school evacuated after
OL,4,Asecurity threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA junior school had to be evacuated
OL,7,Fafter what has been described as a
OL,8,F"reported security threat", a trust
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FFirside Junior School in Hellesdon,
OL,12,Fnear Norwich, moved all pupils and
OL,13,Fstaff to Hellesdon High School, on the
OL,14,Fsame road, as a precaution following
OL,15,Fpolice advice.
OL,17,FWensum Trust, which runs both schools,
OL,18,Fsaid the nature of the threat was not
OL,19,Fknown and there was no immediate need
OL,20,Ffor parents and carers to collect their
OL,21,Fchildren from the school.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
