OL,3,GNEWSAJunior school evacuated after
OL,4,Asecurity threat
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We recognise that this situation may
OL,7,Fcause concern for families and the
OL,8,Fwider community, and thank everyone for
OL,9,Ftheir patience, understanding and
OL,10,Fcooperation as we prioritise the safety
OL,11,Fof our children and staff," a trust
OL,12,Fspokesperson said.
